b=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tr_h8jVgW6sQ7kNvwFr2WRi&_nc_oc=AdkEjokobfr-WuSTViC6CO52LpGp2_PlK0-Sn8XS_B2ePfiPp5k4oe5w48AhvFSWrrc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw0QKtw-rfYo942wjnwDCINpzYD6hufSoZdBlhQyxhz1w&oe=69BE947A"}, "display_name": "Fruit Golf", "keywords": ["family", "party", "mobile", "multiplayer", "coop"], "long_description": "# A Party Game Built on Pure Sabotage.\nTake turns surviving the course while your friends unleash sabotage; sharks, explosions, flying pigs, and total nonsense. Winning is optional. Ruining someone else\u2019s turn is mandatory.\n{1178795550894396}**Choose Carefully. Every Fruit Plays by Different Rules.** Every fruit bends the rules in its own way, with unique physics and quirks that can turn a simple putt into a power move\u2026 If you can master it! \n{871299389056939}\n# HOW TO PLAY:\n\n# MULTIPLE HEADSETS\nGo head-to-head in VR! Online or in-person, take turns golfing and sabotaging.\n\n# ONE HEADSET HOTSEAT\nOne headset, many saboteurs! Friends join FREE on phones (www.fruitgolf.com) to wreak havoc.\n\n# SOLO PRACTICE\nHone your swing, conquer challenges, and enjoy the hilarious physics of Fruit Golf! \n{2057401171694269}**Unlock the Drip. Flex the Chaos.** Crush challenges, unlock ridiculous gear, and make sure everyone knows you did it first.\n{861375006303270}**Weaponized Nonsense.** Sabotage every move with floppy sharks, ectoplasm, portals, mouse traps and more! If it causes chaos, it\u2019s fair game.\n{3524926690977542}**Golf Course or Battle Arena?** Fight it out in wildly themed spaces; underwater, in orbit, on the kitchen counter, then stack the deck with obstacles and turn it into pure mayhem!", "short_description": "A Game Built on Sabotage! One headset, many saboteurs! Mobile friends join for FREE (www.fruitgolf.com) to add to the chaos. \ud83c\udf40 **Special St. Patrick's Day Avatar and Club this Month! Join our Discord to claim your in-game rewards!** \ud83c\udf08"}]}, "developer_na